  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large paella pan or skillet over medium high heat.",
    "Add the smoked paprika and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the diced onion and cook until it is translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the chopped artichoke hearts, diced red bell pepper, salt, and black pepper, and cook for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the short grain brown rice and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the tomato ketchup and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 20 minutes."
